  "assessment": [
    "Actual helper source independently confirms that controller identity is read before a formal Session dispatch and the old Stamp requires exactly one link; changing only the main APK reader would not complete the fix.",
    "The new predicate requires a regular nonempty file with positive link count and no group/other write bits. It does not make the link count itself an authorization source.",
